The Chairman of the Local Party Working Group called on all constituencies of the Cambodian People's Party and other constituencies to vote for the Cambodian People's Party to jointly develop the nation to be more prosperous.
He said that the Cambodian People's Party has always considered the interests of the nation and the people, and the Royal Government led by the Cambodian People's Party has laid down policies and strategies that are realistic, realistic and based on the needs of the people. Exactly. He thanked all voters who voted for the CPP in the February 2024 Senate election.
His Excellency's speech was made during a meeting with the Cambodian community in the Republic of Korea on the afternoon of May 18, 2024.
Samdech President Hun Manet stated that the case of fraud of former tycoon Leng Channa Samdech has taken action since mid-February 2024 after receiving the information, Samdech assigned Mr. Say Sam Al, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction to start studying the case. This will find a compromise, as is the case with other real estate plots.
Samdech continued that after researching and trying to mediate after the outbreak of the reaction, it became clear that Leng Channa's investment project was a fraudulent project, which is why Samdech ordered the authorities to detain him and send him to court on March 12, 2024.
Samdech President Hun Manet stated that the case of Leng Channa's fraud is not over and the Royal Government will continue to take action as the Royal Government continues to investigate the scammers in Leng Channa's project.
Samdech further stated that the main goal of the Royal Government is not only to arrest the people involved in this fraud case and send it to the court, but also to collect the capital from the scammers to solve for the people who are the victims as much as possible. Possible.
Please be informed that the former tycoon Leng Channa and many of his allies were detained by the authorities and sent to court, and the court also decided to detain them after they conspired to defraud people of millions of dollars.
Marcos made the remarks at a graduation ceremony for Filipino military students on Saturday, May 18, with orders for all recent graduates to protect the safety of their people, territory, stability, democracy and self-defense. Threats. "Against the invaders who do not recognize our territorial integrity, we will absolutely defend what belongs to us," he said.
This announcement was made on the occasion that Samdech met with the Cambodian community in South Korea on the afternoon of May 18, 2024 during the official visit.
Samdech Hun Manet took this opportunity to thank the people of South Korea as well as the Cambodian people in the world for sending a message of support for the Funan Techo Prek Chik project, a project for all of us Cambodians.
Samdech also stated, "This project does not belong to Samdech Techo or to the clan. I told you and I once said that the clan has a small part to participate and encourage, but it is a project that "Born out of the support of the Cambodian people around the world, it is our Cambodian project that must be protected and made possible."
According to Samdech Thipadei, the Funan Techo canal project is not important for the participation of foreign investors, but it is important for Cambodia to do it and must work together. Samdech stated that this canal project is not to capture anyone to oppose anyone, but to unite Cambodians against underdevelopment.
"We work together to reduce poverty, together to promote Cambodia to become a more prosperous country, and this canal will provide independence, provide energy for the future development of Cambodia, which Cambodians across "Countries and the world support and must do." This is according to the additional confirmation of Samdech Thipadei.
Key Remarks by Samdech Mani Hun Manet Opportunity to Meet with Cambodian Community in the Republic of Korea
(Phnom Penh): The Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Manet and Lok Chumteav Dr. Pech Chanmony met with the Cambodian community in the Republic of Korea on the afternoon of May 18, 2024.
* Samdech Mani Hun Manet expressed his pleasure to meet with Cambodians in Korea. The President considered this meeting as a special meeting of Samdech's visit to Korea.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet conveyed a message of greetings from Samdech Techo Hun Sen to all Cambodians living, studying and working in Korea.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet said that the current meeting shows the unity in the spirit of the Khmer people who always intercept each other.
* President Hun Manet thanked the Korean diplomats for their efforts in providing various services to the Cambodian people in Korea.
* President Hun Manet stated that every meeting with the Korean leadership praised the efforts of Cambodians living, working and studying in Korea.
* President Hun Manet stated that the good attitude of the Cambodians in Korea is to promote the honor and reputation of the Cambodians, which is the happiest and most exciting thing.
* President Hun Manet stated that the great success of his current visit to Korea is to raise the level of relations from normal relations to strategic partnerships.
* President Hun Manet stated that the "Strategic Partnership" will deepen the relationship and cooperation between Cambodia and Korea in all fields and bring more results.
* President Hun Manet stated that he expects that the "strategic partnership" between Cambodia and Korea will increase the trade volume between Cambodia and Korea.
* President Hun Manet stated that by raising the level of relations, it shows that the leaders of Cambodia and Korea have the same vision and attach importance to the relationship between the two countries.
* President Hun Manet stated that he had promoted direct flights between Siem Reap and other Korean provinces, such as Busan, Jeju, and Incheon.
Samdech Hun Sen stated that his current visit to Korea is the second important task. This includes organizing business forums between Cambodia and Korea, as well as face-to-face meetings with investors.
* Samdech Mani Hun Manet stated that in the past five months, about 147 investment projects have been approved. The investment project has a total capital of $ 2.7 billion, creating more than 140,000 jobs.
Samdech Hun Sen said that both investment and entertainment, if they do not love Cambodia, do not come to Cambodia.
* President Hun Manet stated that what makes Korea love Khmer is part of the Cambodian people who are living, studying and working in Korea. In this sense, Samdech asked Cambodians in Korea to maintain their honor and dignity.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the main goal of the Royal Government is to create quality jobs to boost the national economy. Priority work is to promote local employment, but also recognize that organizing overseas work as an option for citizens also needs to be done.
* Prime Minister Hun Manet mocked the opposition for criticizing the government for leading migrants to work abroad, but when asked if they would lead a ban on people going to work in Korea? Still can not answer.
* President Hun Manet stated that working in Korea earns income and skills.
* President Hun Manet stated that Cambodia is striving to transform from a garment industry to a high-level industry, so workers from Korea will help complete this technical skill.
* President Hun Manet stated that 1 million Koreans work in the United States and 500,000 work in Japan.
* President Hun Manet stated that creating jobs abroad is about creating more choices for the people, not coercion.
* Samdech Mani Hun Manet stated that in the past 10 years, the number of Cambodian workers working in Korea has increased by more than 60,000. By 2024, the quota for Cambodian workers will be increased to 1,150 per year.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that there are three reasons for Cambodian workers to have job opportunities in Korea, including: 1) Reconnection in 1997, which is the struggle of Samdech Techo, 2) the efforts of relevant ministries and institutions and Third, because of the Cambodian workers themselves who are diligent and do not cause problems to the Korean boss.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet expressed his deep gratitude to all Cambodians in Korea and continued to maintain a good attitude.
* President Hun Manet stated that there are currently more than 8,000 Cambodians in Korea.
* Samdech Hun Manet stated that the Constitution of Cambodia requires the Royal Government to protect the Cambodian people everywhere, both inside and outside the country.
* Samdech Mani Hun Manet stated that the Royal Government of Cambodia does not abandon Cambodian citizens in Korea under any circumstances.
* Samdech Manipadei Hun Manet stated that the real estate problem starts from two issues: wrong assessment between customers and wrong assessment of investment.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that the case of Leng Channa's fraud, Samdech took action since February 2024 after receiving information.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet appealed to home buyers under the project who have a clear will, if possible, should continue to pay the company to be able to build a house.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that after the research after the reaction erupted, it became clear that Leng Channa's investment project was a fraudulent project. That is why Samdech ordered his arrest on March 12, 2024.
* Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet stated that the fraud case of Leng Channa, the Royal Government is not over and will continue to take action forever.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet stated that the Royal Government does not leave the problems of the people without finding measures to solve them as much as possible.
* Samdech Mani Hun Manet gives an additional 3 months to the identification officer to get a passport for a citizen in Korea.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet recommends providing Khmer language education to Cambodian children in Korea.
* President Hun Manet thanked Cambodians in Korea for announcing their support for the Funan Techo Canal Project. Samdech Thipadei stated that this project does not belong to Samdech or Samdech Techo, but to the whole of Cambodia.
* Samdech Manipadei Hun Manet stated that the Funan Techo canal project will start construction soon.
Samdech Samdech Hun Manet asked the people to believe that Samdech will strive to maintain peace, build national development and reduce the poverty of the people as much as possible.
Korean National Assembly Speaker Congratulates President of the Republic of Korea on Official Visit to the Republic of Korea
He also highlighted two initiatives, namely: (1) the establishment of a regular consultation mechanism between the Korean Business Association in Cambodia and government agencies, and (2) the establishment of a special economic zone for Korean investment companies through Create a special and unique business environment for Korean companies doing business in Cambodia.
In the field of education, he mentioned the potential of cooperation between Cambodian universities and Korean universities in training human resources, especially in the digital sector, which will promote the diversification of the workforce as well as address the real needs of the market. That Cambodia has a lot of young people who can receive training at the skill level and can contribute to filling the labor shortage in Korea as well.
Finally, the President and the President of the National Assembly exchanged views on the direction of cooperation between the two countries, especially in contributing to the promotion of the "strategic partnership" between Cambodia and Korea for the benefit of the people and the two countries.
ASEAN Secretary-General to pay working visit to Japan to boost ASEAN diplomacy and strengthen ASEAN-Japan comprehensive strategic partnership
During the visit, the ASEAN Secretary-General is scheduled to meet with senior Japanese government officials, education officials and the business community to discuss and explore ways to strengthen the ASEAN-Japan comprehensive strategic partnership.
5th Army Continues to Protect, Prevent and Suppress Natural Forest Land Invasion in Veal Veng District, Pursat Province
(Pursat): On May 18, 2024, 275 troops of the 5th Military Region, led by Major General Seng Thearin, Deputy Commander and Chief of Staff of the 5th Military Region, continued to carry out operations to prevent and suppress encroachment. Natural forest land is located in O'Som commune, Veal Veng district, Pursat province.
This operation was carried out in accordance with the high-level remarks of the Prime Minister of Cambodia, His Excellency Hun Manet, on March 19, 2024, Notification No. 1361 of the Ministry of Interior dated 24 April. 2024, Order of the Commander-in-Chief of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces No. 013 / NPC dated 2 April 2024 and the spirit of the meeting on 13 May 2024 under the chairmanship of General Mao Sophan, Deputy Commander of the Land Forces.
Lt. Gen. Seng Thearin confirmed that in accordance with the orders of the Deputy Commander of the Army, the Commander of the 5th Army Division, this operation will use a total force of 1,000 people to carry out operations to protect, prevent and suppress the encroachment on natural forest land to take state land. Owned in four provinces: Pursat, Battambang, Pailin and Banteay Meanchey, which caused damage and destruction of public property, state natural forest conservation areas.
He claimed that the operation was to prevent and suppress the crackdown without exception, by researching and taking legal action against criminals using tactics to destroy natural forests and protected areas. CPP Leaders in Preah Sihanouk Province March for Capital, Province, Municipality, District and Khan Council Election Campaign
(Preah Sihanouk): The Cambodian People's Party (CPP) in Preah Sihanouk Province met with members at Techo Square in Sangkat 4, Sihanoukville in the presence of Mr. Vong Phannath, Chairman of the Provincial Council and Mr. Kouch Charoeun, Chairman of the Provincial Committee of the CPP in Preah Sihanouk Province. On the morning of May 17, 2024, to march to open the election campaign for the provincial council, municipal council and district council.
Mr. Teng Vandy, Chairman of the Provincial Election Commission, told Fresh News Preah Sihanouk Province that the political party march on May 17 included:
* First: The Cambodian People's Party marched in 5 cities and districts with a total of 4,000 participants. March by car, motorbike and have a microphone to disseminate the party's policies. * Second: FUNCINPEC plays a microphone at the provincial party headquarters in Prey Nob and Kampong Seila districts. National forces are inactive.
Mr. Teng Vandy added that the election campaign for the fourth mandate council will last for eight days from May 17 to 24, 2024.
Senior officials of the Ministry of Public Works instruct the officers and forces stationed at the weighing station to strengthen the inspection work of vehicles thoroughly and clearly
(Pursat): Mr. Seng Chhuon, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport and Chairman of the Standing Coordinating Committee of the Overweight Transport Inspection Committee, instructed the officers and the station staff to pay more attention. Strengthen vehicle inspection work thoroughly and clearly, as well as know how to cooperate in performing work more effectively.
Mr. Seng Chhuon introduced this on May 16, 2024, when he presided over the announcement ceremony of the composition of the director of Khleang Moeung station in Pursat province and was accompanied by Mr. Mey Marady, Undersecretary of State in charge of the Personnel Department. Director of the Secretariat and Director of the Department of Public Works and Transport of Pursat Province.
It should be noted that the appointment of the new station manager is made after the former station chief who has retired and in order to strengthen the efficiency of work performance, exchange of work experience on the prevention of overweight transport to the limit more effectively.
At the same time, Mr. Seng Chhuon praised the leadership of the former station director who paid attention and implemented the work to prevent overweight work in the past.
It should be noted that in the past, the Standing Committee of the Steering Committee for the Inspection of Overweight Trucks has also changed the composition of officers at some stations.
Mr. Nop Rath Nimol thanked the officials and citizens of Takeo province for supporting the Funan Techo Prek Chik project.
(Takeo): Mr. Nop Rath Nimol, Assistant to the Prime Minister Hun Sen, thanked civil servants, local authorities, the Armed Forces and the people of Takeo Province, as well as people across the country for their support of the Funan-Techo Canal Project. Will greatly benefit the national economy and the people of Cambodia in the future.
Mr. Nop Rath Nimol expressed his gratitude on the occasion of his visit as a representative of the Honorary General Dr. Hing Bun Heang and Ms. Pen Channy to meet and distribute gifts to 300 families in Sangkat Rokar Knoung and Sangkat Baray in Daun Keo city, Takeo province, this morning, May 18, 2024.
The situation of poor families in Daun Keo city has a total of 2,490 poor families, including: Poor families: 278 families in total, 245 families in Roka Krao commune, 18 families in Roka Knoang and 15 families in Baray. Poor families: 646 families in total, 342 families in Roka Krao commune, 116 families in Roka commune and 188 families in Baray.
On that occasion, Mr. Nop Rath Nimol brought greetings from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Senate and Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, Samdech President Hun Manet, Prime Minister and Lok Chumteav Bandith, as well as from Honorary General Dr. Hing. Bun Heang and Lok Chumteav to the people of Daun Keo City, Takeo Province.
Mr. Nop Rath Nimol emphasized that under the wise and skillful leadership of the Cambodian People's Party and the Royal Government, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, in the past, has worked hard to rebuild and develop the nation from scratch. From the ashes left over from the genocidal regime of Pol Pot and make the society prosperous in all fields.
On behalf of the Honorary General Dr. Hing Bun Heang and Mrs. Pen Channy, Mr. Nop Rath Nimol brought the precious humanitarian donations of Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit to distribute to 300 families in 2 communes (Roka Knong and Baray). The family has: 25 kg of rice, 2 small boxes of noodles, 2 sticks and 30,000 Riels, as well as 2 million Riels for the City Hall and the competent forces.
South Korean volunteer doctors provide free medical check-ups and treatment to people in Chum Kiri district, Kampot province
(Kampot): Mr. Nim Chandara, Member of Parliament and Member of National Assembly of Kampot Province, and Mr. Yim Sinan, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training and Member of the Royal Government Working Group for Kampot Province on May 17, 2024, led a team of doctors. PMCI South Korean Volunteers Visit and Treat People in Chres Commune, Organized at Bak Nim Primary School in Bak Nim Village, Chres Commune, Chum Kiri District, Kampot Province.
Meanwhile, the Member of Parliament of Kampot Province also thanked the people now who voted for the Cambodian People's Party in the seventh mandate, which has made more achievements for our people, especially the people. People are living a better life to another level. He thanked all the doctors and staff for dedicating their precious time, energy and personal money to help the people of Cambodia.
Mr. Yim Sinan, a member of the working group of the Royal Government to help Kampot province, advised the people to participate here to check and treat the disease carefully, and please do not worry at all, if you have any questions, please ask. At the doctor, what disease we have, the doctor will respond to our brothers.
The Secretary of State continued that as an official of the Royal Government, he will try his best to find a way to do it in the framework throughout the country, especially in Kampot, especially in this geographical location, he will do his best with the Royal Government to do. May our people be on the path to prosperity and harmony.
The Secretary of State also stated that a team of 60 Korean doctors visited and treated the main diseases, including:
Dr. Kim Yong-sung, a rehabilitation specialist from Korea, said that the reason he brought a team of doctors to treat the Cambodian people was because in 1950, when Korea was at war, Cambodia went to help the country. Korea, too, according to history. These examinations and treatments are conducted throughout the country to improve the health of local people.
In particular, the people who were examined were happy because they received the services of medical examination and treatment by the medical team and thanked the Member of Parliament and the Secretary of State who are members of the working group. Visit the base, which always considers the well-being of the people.
Cambodian Prime Minister Hun Manet: "Strategic partnership" will improve Cambodia-Korea relations and cooperation (Video inside) (Seoul, South Korea): Cambodian Prime Minister Hun Manet expressed optimism that The level of "strategic partnership" will further enhance the relationship and cooperation between Cambodia and Korea.
During the meeting, the Chairman of the Standing Committee thanked the President for taking the time to allow him and the ICAPP delegation to pay a courtesy call and discuss the work, and highly appreciated the excellent results of the cooperation. The operation between ICAPP and Cambodia would like to thank Cambodia for its support and assistance to ICAPP, which has made ICAPP a resounding success in organizing general conferences.
In addition, Jung Eun-yeon expressed his pleasure at the official visit of the President to the Republic of Korea, which has made the political environment in Korea more beautiful through the public presence of the First Lady of the Republic of Korea in During the official visit of the President on this occasion.
The Chairman of the Standing Committee also congratulated the President on his successful visit to the Republic of Korea and expressed optimism that this will further strengthen and expand bilateral relations and cooperation, especially on The economy, trade, investment, tourism and people-to-people connections of the two countries.
He also thanked the Government and people of the Republic of Korea for their continued attention to the Cambodian people and students living, working and studying in Korea, and thanked the Korean government for its continued support. Labor quota for Cambodia from year to year.
He stressed that Cambodia will pay close attention to the organization of the 12th ICAPP General Assembly, which will be held in Phnom Penh with great pomp and success.
Please note that Cambodia and South Korea were officially established diplomatic relations on October 30, 1997. This diplomatic bond was re-established under the strong efforts of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, or Samdech Techo as a midwife, to establish relations between Cambodia and South Korea.
After the formal establishment, relations and cooperation between the two countries have been further strengthened and enhanced.
Nearly 30 years after the re-establishment of this relationship, during the President's visit to South Korea, Cambodia and South Korea have now decided to upgrade their relationship to a "strategic partner".
