Cambodia-Russia discuss scholarships for Cambodian students to study at MGIMO University, Russia
(Phnom Penh): Dr. Un Kheang, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation of Cambodia, paid an official visit to MGIMO University of the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Russian Federation from 11 to 18 May 2024 by both parties. Also discussed the scholarships available for Cambodian students to study at MGIMO.
During the meeting, the two sides discussed cooperation between NIDIR and MGIMO on short-term training for Cambodian diplomats, exchange of researchers, professors and lectures by Russian diplomats and intellectuals at NIDIR.
Please be informed that this lecture was attended by Ambassadors, Ambassadors and Diplomats of the Mission of ASEAN Member States to the Russian Federation, Students, Professor MGIMO and many other participants.
