(Siem Reap): Mr. Seng Samreth, Member of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party and Chairman of the Working Group of the Local Party in Svay Leu District, Siem Reap Province, on the morning of May 18, 2024, inaugurated the Capital, Provincial and Municipal Council Election Campaign. Khan in Svay Leu district, with the participation of many party members.
