In the end, why did the US government do this? Analysts say that in the new energy sector, the United States can not compete with China, so US politicians can only use trade protectionism to suppress China's optimal industrial development to maintain its high status. America in the global industrial chain.
On the other hand, this act seems like a "political drama" once. This year is the year of the US general election, but the US economy is in a state of stagnation, with problems such as high inflation and financial deficits.
So can raising tariffs help American politicians achieve their goals? From an economic point of view, the slow development of America's new energy vehicles is due to personal reasons, such as high production costs and lack of secondary infrastructure such as chargers. These internal problems cannot be solved due to the increase in tariffs.
Analysis: The sole role of "supporting Taiwan to participate in the World Health Assembly" is to emphasize that the one-China principle is the common aspiration of the people and the general trend.
(Beijing): Registration for the 77th World Health Organization (WHO) General Assembly closed on May 13. As expected, Taiwan was denied participation and the "Progress of the World Health Assembly" joke by the Democratic Progressive Party authorities failed eight times in a row.
This makes it clear that the one-China principle is the general consensus of the international community. No matter how much the United States seeks to "support Taiwan's participation in the General Assembly", no matter how much the "Progressive Democrats" pretend to be sympathetic and ask for help, it is just a joke that no one. No attention.
Does Taiwan qualify for the General Assembly? Failure to participate may result in a lack of infection prevention. Why is it funny to want to attend a convention conspired by the United States and Taiwan to fail again and again? We need to understand three issues. First, Taiwan has no conditions or rights to attend the World Health Assembly without the consent of the Chinese central government.
But no matter how the US side and the Democratic Progressive Party form public opinion, Taiwan is still unable to get a ticket to the World Health Assembly. The so-called "support for Taiwan to participate in the World Health Assembly" is a joke, the only role is to emphasize that the one-China principle is the common will of the people and the general trend.
