"Boeung Kanseng" will be a place with a clean environment, a clean resort, beautiful and attractive to welcome national and international tourists during the Water Festival November 2024
(Ratanakkiri): Boeung Kanseng will be a place with a clean environment, clean resort, beauty, attractive to welcome national and international tourists during the Water Festival November 2024. This is what Mr. Nhem Sam Oeun, Governor of Ratanakkiri Province, said at the groundbreaking ceremony for the new hermitage of Mr. Ta Chuong and Mr. Kham Len, which was held on the morning of May 17, 2024.
The provincial governor said that Boeung Kanseng is located in the heart of Banlung city, Ratanakkiri province. Therefore, in order to promote the beauty, public order and orderliness of the area around Boeung Kanseng resort to be suitable as a historical resort and an entertainment place for the people in the province as well as national and international visitors to visit the province, he set out a project to improve Infrastructure and development of this resort area.
In fact, the project to improve the infrastructure around the mouth of Kanseng Lake includes cleaning the wolves that grow into the lake surface in the south, widening the road by pouring concrete, installing drainage, preparing concrete, edge of the road, preparing corridors, sidewalks, gardens around the lake and providing public lighting. And so on.
The people and government officials in Ratanakkiri are very proud of the leadership of Mr. Nhem Sam Oeun, who has a vision to build and develop this northeastern province, especially the work of sanitation, environment and aesthetics to make Banlung more attractive. Lose the provinces.
Please note that the hermitage of Grandpa Chuong and Grandpa Khamlen, which held the groundbreaking ceremony for the new building, is 5 meters by 7 meters, built on the old site and will be raised above 6 water.
