After appearing in front of the two suspects, the competent force has prepared a case file and sent it to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court to proceed with the procedure. The 2nd China-ASEAN Innovation and Entrepreneurship Competition Finished Successfully
The event is designed to further promote scientific and technological innovation cooperation between China and ASEAN countries, enhance the Sino-ASEAN regional innovation capacity and promote the vigorous development of scientific and technological cooperation.
With the theme "Digital Empowerment for a Common Future", the competition focuses on the current hotspots of science and technology in the region, focusing on the digital economy, collecting projects from universities, scientific research institutes, enterprises and other social institutions. In China and ASEAN countries, as well as receiving widespread attention and active participation.
Since the start of the event in July 2013, more than 280 projects have been registered for the competition. After a fierce competition, a total of 20 outstanding creative and entrepreneurial projects from China, Indonesia, Malaysia, the Philippines, Thailand, Vietnam, Cambodia, Brunei and other countries and regions received outstanding evaluations and reached the finals.
At the finals, the participating teams are divided into two groups: the competition team and the enterprise team, go through the quiz form and show “7 + 5” to broadly describe the characteristics and advantages of their project. After scoring by a panel of experts, the first, second and third place winners and seven creative stars of the enterprise and competition teams are finally selected.
