Neak Oknha Vinh Hour, Chairman of Kampot Pod Board of Directors, said, "The special feature is that we can import raw materials for textile factories, shoe factories, etc. Raw materials for cement factories We currently have 6 cement factories, of which Kampot has 4 cement factories, Kampong Speu has 1 and Battambang has 1, and all of these factories need to import raw materials such as plaster.
