Samdech Techo Hun Sen's statement was made during a special message on Prek Chik Funan Techo on May 16, 2024, after foreign media and some analysts said that the Prek Chik project Cambodia's Funan Techo is under China's belt and road initiative.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that for the publication of foreign newspapers, considering that Funan Techo canal is a Chinese initiative within the framework of one belt and one road. At the point of Vietnam's concern regarding the Funan-Techo canal is not necessary.
At the same time, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also reprimanded those who always accuse Cambodia of being geographically connected and inclined towards anti-China, please stop this immediately, it is stupid that people do not know The root of the problem. The initiative to dig the Funan Techo canal is purely Cambodian.
