* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reaffirms that Funan Techo canal will help irrigation system in southwestern Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the extraction of water for irrigation does not cause water loss up to 50%.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continued to confirm that the Funan Techo canal will help release water when Cambodia is flooded.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continued to confirm that Prek Chun Funan Techo will help increase fish production and fish farming of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Funan Techo canal will also contribute to the tourism sector and the people will benefit from tourism.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech has been the Prime Minister and has passed through almost 10 Vietnamese Prime Ministers, and Samdech has negotiated a lot on the use of this waterway.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the transportation of goods by relying on Vietnamese waterways leads to many problems, such as inspection of goods, lifting many times, the implementation of quality measures takes a long time ....
