* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asks people to be interested in the independence of transportation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia does not need to be hostile to Vietnam. Cambodia regards all friends.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia votes in a proportional system, so everything must follow the party line. Therefore, the Prime Minister can not do anything at will.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen warns the opposition not to push the Cambodian Prime Minister to deviate from the party's political line, there is no way.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech does not need the Cambodian people to take Vietnam as an enemy and also does not need Vietnam to take Cambodia as an enemy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he wanted the Cambodian people to clearly note that what is more important than the economy, the Funan Techo canal project is political independence on transportation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded in the past that when the Sangkum Reastr Niyum regime did not agree with South Vietnam, then Cambodia could not use the waterway from the river to the sea.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Vietnam is a prosperous country that will become a G20 country, so Vietnam does not need to be rich through the cost of shipping by Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that neighboring countries need to build good relations with each other, but like tongues and teeth, there is no escape from conflict.
