* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked Vietnamese environmentalists for coming out and claiming that the water flowing through the Funan Techo canal was very small compared to the amount of water flowing through Vietnam today.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that on March 18, 2020, Vietnam closed all borders, leading to severe congestion of goods into Vietnam. In response to this measure, Samdech urged the border to be closed to prevent people from crossing the border.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen advised to record that May 16, 2024 is the time when Samdech Techo announced that the Funan Techo canal was to strengthen the independence of Cambodia's transportation policy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Vietnamese leaders also always thanked Cambodia for helping to liberate southern Vietnam.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Vietnamese leader never forgot the merits of Samdech Norodom Sihanouk who helped Vietnam.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that efforts must be made to strengthen economic and political independence. But as a poor country, it is very difficult, so what can be done for independence must be done.
