Nevertheless, the current drug prevention campaign has become a hot topic in restricting the participation of the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia to all ministries and civil society organizations in Cambodia. .
It is seen that through the campaign to tighten the issue, both national and sub-national institutions have tried to publicize the consequences of drug use and put in place drug testing measures. And if a person is found to have drugs in his body, he will be expelled from the Ministry without exception.
