(Kampong Thom): Mr. Touch Sokha, Deputy Governor of Kampong Thom Province, called on the people to cooperate with cadastral expertise in systematic measurement in accordance with the national plan.
Mr. Touch Sokha spoke at the handing over ceremony of 2,703 real estate certificates to citizens in 2 villages in Chamna Krom commune, Stong district, Kampong Thom province on May 15, 2024.
He called on all citizens to cooperate with relevant experts, especially cadastre, who are conducting systematic surveys to become full owners and implement the Royal Government's strategic plan to provide systematic land titles to citizens. Completed by the end of 2025.
