Modern community wants to supply a large part of safe vegetables in Siem Reap by 2027
(Siem Reap): Modern Sor Sey community in Banteay Srei district has vowed to try to supply more safe vegetables in the market in Siem Reap by 2027 as the community is preparing 100 net vegetable houses in the near future This. The community's promise was made in the presence of the Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, Mr. Dith Tina, during a meeting with the community on May 08, 2024.
Mao Vorleak, President of Modern Sorsey Community, stated: “Modern Sorsey Community will work together to maximize market share in Siem Reap by 2027. It is a community project, we want to lead in Vegetable supply in Siem Reap.
He said that the demand for safe vegetables grown in the country today is wide because people understand that some imported vegetables may contain chemicals to maintain quality for a long time, which affects the health, so the community wants. Grow safe vegetables, reduce chemicals so that people can eat safely.
The Sar Sey Modern Community is a joint venture of farmers who have land for farming and are integrated into the community. 500 square meters of land put into the community equal to 1 share equal to 50,000 riels. In the past, the community used to grow kale, dwarf veil, grow grass for raising cattle, grow crops for sunflower oil, corn, coconut, coconut and so on.
"I am very happy that the minister has come to the community and expressed his support for the modern community by providing capital and the relevant ministries to intervene so that we can set up a net house," he said. "The first 100, and the Minister also let us learn to walk first, do not want us to walk and have problems not to lose big.
At the ceremony, Minister Dith Tina instructed the newly established agricultural community to start building a net house that is close to the water and easy to collect, starting from one hectare. He said that due to the lack of water and can not yet assess the potential crops on the land that need to be done in any form that is possible and not risky and manageable.
At the same time, he also advised the community to review and adjust the investment plan of the modern community according to the real situation of the community. In addition, he stressed that the community must pay more attention to the participation of Community membership and good management to ensure success, benefit members in line with the goals of the policy program.
