(Phnom Penh): Mr. Nuon Pharath, Deputy Governor of Phnom Penh, represented by Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of the Board of Governors, welcomed 240 outstanding students from the 2023-2024 academic year from the capital and provinces throughout the Kingdom of Cambodia to visit the Victory Monument. Win this morning, Wednesday, May 15, 2024.
This visit takes place on the occasion of Phnom Penh hosting the National Student Excellence Examination for the 2023-2024 school year.
The 240 candidates passed the writing process of Khmer Literature, Mathematics, Physics and General Culture, Grade 9 and Grade 12 on May 13-14, 2024 at Chea Sim Santhor Mok High School Examination Center, Phnom Penh. This exam will be announced on May 16, 2024.
On the occasion of the students waiting for the results of this exam, the Phnom Penh Capital Administration has arranged for all the candidates to visit the Victory Monument, which is located in Sangkat Prek Ta Sek, Khan Chroy Changva, Phnom Penh.
