Kampong Thom Provincial Prosecutor's Office issues a press release on the transfer of jurisdiction in the case of Sun Chanthy, Isarim and Trek Nheun to Phnom Penh Municipal Court
(Phnom Penh): The spokesperson of the Kampong Thom Provincial Prosecutor's Office on May 13, 2024 issued a press release on the transfer of jurisdiction in the case involving Sun Chanthy, Isa Ream and Trek Nhoeun from Kampong Thom province. Return to the court and the prosecutor of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court.
After a thorough investigation, the Prosecutor's Office opened an investigation and requested that Sun Chanthy, Isariem, and Trek Nhoeun be placed under investigation for fraud under Articles 377 and 378 of the Penal Code. 2009. However, on May 9, 2024, Sun Chanthy was arrested and detained in Phnom Penh in connection with another crime.
A spokesman for the Kampong Thom Provincial Prosecutor's Office further stated that in order to ensure the public interest, safety, social security and good functioning as well as the speed of justice, the Prosecutor's Office requested permission to transfer Criminal Case No. 173 dated 13 February 2024 of the Prosecutor of Kampong Thom Provincial Court to the Court and the Prosecutor of the Phnom Penh Municipal Court by letter No. 1097 KYOR / 24 dated 10 May 2024 of the Ministry of Justice.
