During her diplomatic mission in Cambodia, the Ambassador is committed to further strengthening and expanding relations and cooperation between the two countries. In addition, the Ambassador informed the President about the continued promotion of Canada-Cambodia trade and investment cooperation, as well as the strengthening of quality investment by Canadian companies in Cambodia.
Regarding trade and investment, HE Hun Manet emphasized that currently the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce has established a representative of the Chamber of Commerce in Canada as part of the linkages and cooperation in trade and investment between the two countries. Two.
In addition, the Prime Minister briefed the Ambassador on the policy of attracting and encouraging investors in Cambodia through the implementation of the Investment Law of the Kingdom of Cambodia, as well as the introduction of practical policies to support the investment climate and sustainability. Cambodia's competition in both regional and global frameworks.
