Ministry of Water Resources announces weather conditions in Cambodia for May 12, 2024
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology has issued a notification on the weather situation in Cambodia for May 12, 2024.
Low pressure covers the Gulf of Thailand, the Kingdom of Cambodia, the central Mekong Basin and the South China Sea, the ministry said. This situation will make: From 12 to 14 May 2024:
1. Lowland area: * Minimum temperature 24 ° C and maximum temperature 36 ° C. Winds from the southeast and southwest have an average speed of 2 m / s. Banteay Meanchey, Siem Reap, Battambang, Pursat, Kampong Cham, Kampong Chhnang, Kampong Thom and Kandal provinces may experience rain with thunder and gust covering 20% of the area.
2. Upland areas: * Minimum temperature 24 ° C and maximum temperature 36 ° C. Winds from the west and southwest average 2.5 meters per second. Oddar Meanchey, Tbong Khmum, Pailin and Cardamom mountainous areas may experience rain with thunder, lightning and gust covering 10% of the area.
