It should be noted that the Phnom Penh Municipal Police arrested Tycoon Hee Kim Hong, the owner of the World Gold Company and a group of 14 bodyguards in connection with the case of cheating people on the afternoon of August 7, 2023 at the World Gold Company in Trapeang Thlan village. Sangkat Ponsaing, Khan Prek Pnov.
The arrest of the tycoon, the owner of the Golden Land Company, was made on a warrant issued by the Phnom Penh Municipal Court. During the execution of the bodyguard's order, he obstructed the police and used violence against the police.
But after a few months in prison, he was released on bail, while the problem of the people who cheated on this person has not been resolved yet.
