Sambo Meanchey Agricultural Community is a community that supplies a lot of vegetables, especially lemongrass oil to the market, which was established in 2010 with a total of 2,152 members to date.
The progress of the business of Sambo Meanchey farming community started with the savings group to be used as revolving accounting in a community with a total capital of 10,154,000 Riels.
Currently, the community has expanded some other businesses such as rice production, feed production, rice seed production, production of lime leaves and vegetables, fruit trees (banana, owner and watermelon), processing of lime oil, soil composting, chemical fertilizer supply to community members and manure. To customers in the area as well.
