(Phnom Penh): Pen Rithy, alias Mov, alias Hea Yuon, 29, an active drug trafficker, was sentenced by the Phnom Penh Municipal Court to three years in prison and fined six years. 000,000 Riel for illegal drug trafficking committed at No. 29 Borey Piphop Thmey, Thmor Da Village, Sangkat Kantouk, Khan Kampol, Phnom Penh during 2021 until June 4, 2023.
