The Prime Minister emphasized that the Royal Government of the 7th legislature of the National Assembly has set the development of human capital as a priority in the Pentagon strategy for job growth, equity, efficiency and sustainability. He stressed that the development of human capital is focused on improving the quality of education and improving technical skills and vocational training.
(Jerusalem): The headquarters of the United Nations Relief and Works Agency for Palestine (UNWRA) in the eastern city of Jerusalem has been temporarily closed after Israeli residents in the area. They set fire to the compound next to the headquarters. This is according to the release by Reuters on Friday, May 10, 2024.
The UNRWA was set up to deal with Palestinian refugees who fled or were forced to flee their homes during the 1945 war, when Israel was formed.
Analysis: "Steel friendship" between China and Serbia will unleash a new vitality in the new era
BEIJING: During Chinese President Xi Jinping's visit to Serbia in 2016, the two heads of state decided to upgrade China-Serbia relations to a comprehensive strategic partnership.
After eight years, how will the "steel friendship" between China and Serbia be upgraded? Chinese President Xi Jinping's state visit to Serbia from May 7 to 8 has already provided answers. The two heads of state jointly announced the deepening and enhancement of comprehensive strategic partnership between China and Serbia to build a common community of common destiny between China and Serbia in the new era.
In addition, the two sides also signed a joint statement on the case and made comprehensive arrangements in various fields. Serbia became the first European country to jointly build a community of common destiny with China, which fully reflected the strategic, unique and advanced nature of Sino-Serbian relations.
With regard to future Chinese-Serbian relations, mutual respect and trust will remain fundamental. China has always fully respected Serbia's sovereignty and territorial integrity and has been supporting Serbia's economic and social development. Serbia, on the other hand, has strongly supported China's legitimate position on issues related to core interests, such as Taiwan.
People-to-people cooperation is the key to boosting Sino-Serbian ties. This time, both China and Serbia agreed to not only continue to cooperate in traditional areas such as trade, export, import, transportation and energy infrastructure, but also to cooperate in innovative fields such as intelligence. Artificial, etc. as well.
Articles and pictures by Cambodia-China Friendship Radio The NEC presents the results of the meeting to disseminate the validation of the official voter list for the 2024 4th Mandate Council Election
(Phnom Penh): The National Election Committee (NEC) has released the results of a meeting to disseminate the validation of the official voter list, the distribution of voter information leaflets and the current number of national and international observers and journalists. National and international news for the Capital Council Election, Provincial Council, Municipal Council, District Council, Khan Council, also known as the 4th Mandate Council in 2024.
The meeting was chaired by Mr. Hang Puthea, Member of the NEC, Chairman of the NEC Spokesperson Group and chaired the meeting on May 10, 2024. From the Constitutional Council, the General Secretariat of the Senate, the Ministry of Interior, the Ministry of National Defense, the General Commission of the National Police, the National Gendarmerie, representatives of political parties and non-governmental organizations, as well as a total of more than 50 journalists.
Speaking at the meeting, Mr. Hang Puthea stated that the NEC has completed the voter registration and registration stages of the political parties and the list of candidates and the lottery to determine the order of names. Political parties are already standing on the ballot. The NEC is preparing to carry out a series of tasks in accordance with the election calendar.
Here are the results of the meeting: The President of Phnom Penh Port considers the Funan Techo canal project as a new waterway transportation system option, which makes the transportation of goods easier and more affordable.
Mr. He Bavy stated that through this canal project, Phnom Penh Autonomous Port will get a new waterway transportation system option, which makes the transportation of goods of customers through Phnom Penh Autonomous Port more convenient, timely and affordable.
He Bavy made the remarks while presiding over the 9th General Assembly of the Phnom Penh Autonomous Port on May 10, 2024.
The Funan-Techo Canal Project is a project to connect waterways between rivers to the sea of Cambodia, passing through Kandal, Takeo, Kampot and Kep provinces, about 180 km long. The project is expected to cost about $ 1.7 billion and has been studied in detail for about 26 months. The project has a water depth of only 5.4 meters.
Deputy Prime Minister Sun Chanthol, First Vice President of the Council for the Development of Cambodia, has stated that the Funan Techo Canal speeds up the transport of goods from the Phnom Penh Autonomous Port to the Cambodian Sea by more than 100 km. Reduce shipping and handling costs by nearly $ 200 per container compared to shipping through Vietnam. By reducing costs, Cambodia increases its competitive advantage.
(Phnom Penh): In 2023, the Phnom Penh Autonomous Port will earn more than 9 million US dollars. This was confirmed by Mr. Heu Bavy, the Royal Government of Cambodia delegate in charge of the Director General of the Phnom Penh Autonomous Port.
Speaking at the 9th General Assembly of Phnom Penh Autonomous Port on May 10, 2024, Mr. He Bavy stated that "The financial results of Phnom Penh Autonomous Port received a profit of $ 9,393,179, which implemented 58 "% Compared to the plan in 2023 and a decrease of 35% compared to the implementation in 2022."
Mr. He Bavy added that for the business results in 2023, Phnom Penh Autonomous Port received 396,225 TEUs of containers that were implemented compared to the plan for 2023 by 85% and decreased by 5% compared to 2022.
The President stated that up to now, the listing on the Cambodia Securities Exchange of Phnom Penh Autonomous Port has been for 9 years, in which the share price of Phnom Penh Autonomous Port has increased continuously, which is a reflection of the growth. And investor trust to Phnom Penh Autonomous Port.
He said that the Phnom Penh Autonomous Port is really honored and proud of the achievements and results achieved.
He added, however, that the Phnom Penh Autonomous Port still has many responsibilities, including the need to continue to implement the port development action plan by strengthening unit management, strengthening and developing human resources, strengthening business / service operations:
(Preah Vihear): Mr. Chhim Sauki, Permanent Secretary of State, on behalf of Mr. Chhay Rithy Sen, Minister of Rural Development, on May 10, 2024, led a delegation to inspect, evaluate and hand over 100% on the construction of the new Preah Vihear Provincial Department of Rural Development. To the civil servants of the Provincial Department of Rural Development for official use from today onwards.
