Please be informed that the new administrative building of Preah Vihear Provincial Department of Rural Development officially started construction on March 29, 2023 and will be completed on March 29, 2024. The two-story building, 20 meters by 10 meters, has 10 rooms and 1 meeting hall using the national budget (Chapter 21) through the Ministry of Rural Development.
