The Minister said that now that the campaign to reduce the use of plastic in Cambodia has been successful, it is the pride of our country. The campaign has reached the second stage, which encourages the participation of the people to come out and clean the houses, villages, organize the distribution of garbage and store garbage according to the type of garbage.
