Samdech Hun Sen: The Royal Government will continue its efforts to improve the investment climate in Cambodia by reducing negative factors and increasing positive factors (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): The government will continue to work to improve the investment climate in Cambodia by reducing negative factors and increasing positive ones.
