He recalled that on May 6, he announced the launch of a one-stop shop program to encourage companies to register and do business online quickly, reducing time and costs.
He said that the reduction of negative factors, solving challenges to the private sector that exist and timely through the mechanism to meet the private sector through a multi-sectoral working group that monitors cells to solve problems will help the sector. Private a lot.
Samdech continued that any problem that can not be solved quickly, the Royal Government will establish another mechanism to ensure efficiency and effectiveness in solving the private sector successfully.
