Samdech Mani President Hun Manet made the remarks on the occasion of the official opening ceremony of the Cambodian Federation of Investors and Solidarity Dinner at the Koh Pich Convention and Exhibition Center on the afternoon of May 9, 2024. .
Samdech President Hun Manet said that the Royal Government for many terms is to promote the development of the country and improve the lives of the people. In particular, turn the history of Cambodia from the bitterness of war to a beautiful country.
Samdech Hun Sen said that the Royal Government has a role to play in peace, stability, market and other factors that the needs of the private sector. The Royal Government led by Samdech is not only theoretical, but values the results on the ground.
In addition to announcing the maintenance of political security and stability in Cambodia, Samdech Hun Sen also announced the maintenance of macroeconomic stability and economic growth, with the Royal Government continuing to promote economic growth in 2023. 5%, according to the forecast, the Cambodian economy will continue to grow even higher, this point is an important goal of the Royal Government from the first day.
Samdech Prime Minister Hun Manet: The Royal Government pays high attention to the private sector and the free market regime to promote development in Cambodia (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Emphasize that the Royal Government of the seventh mandate is paying close attention to the private sector and the free market regime to promote development in Cambodia to achieve the goal of being a high-income country by 2050.
This emphasis was made on the occasion that Samdech Hun Sen presided over the official opening of the Cambodian Federation of Investors and Solidarity Dinner on the evening of May 9, 2024.
Samdech Hun Sen stated that the word "partnership between the state and the private sector" is a word that must be made more active and effective, and the Royal Government is committed to promoting the role of rights of the private sector. To help think, act and take responsibility in national economic development.
Samdech Hun Sen stated that "The Royal Government pays attention to promoting the role of the private sector to participate in the development of the national economy to reach Cambodia can achieve the vision 2050 to transform the country. "To become a high-income country and the living standards of the people are constantly improving."
At the same time, Samdech Hun Sen said that the private sector as well as the Royal Government has an obligation and participation to make this partnership a success. This was especially after the end of the war in 1998.
Samdech Hun Sen said that the previous government led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen had ensured stability, ensured peace, and guaranteed the potential for economic development, so that Cambodia could move towards achieving its goals by 2050. Government policies include:
* Ensure security, social stability * Maintain macroeconomic stability * Support the market economy by ensuring effective legal framework, transparency and transparency * Establish policies and incentives for the private sector * Investors On human resources, both health and knowledge, and investing in key physical infrastructure, roads, water, electricity and technology.
Samdech President Hun Manet stated that the Royal Government led by Samdech is not only theoretical but also values the actual results, the results on the ground. He said that the goal of the new government from the first day was to maintain peace and stability, and the results for the past eight months have been achieved.
