The report states that the personal loan performance for small businesses has achieved strong growth, with credit balances and the number of credit accounts increasing in all areas. The number of individual loan applications for small businesses increased in the first quarter compared to the previous quarter.
The number of individual loan applications for small businesses increased by an overall 3.87%. The number of applications for small business loans increased by 4% compared to the previous quarter. Agricultural loan applications increased by 9% from the previous quarter, construction loan applications increased by 2% from the previous quarter and various loan applications decreased by 12%.
