(Phnom Penh): On Wednesday morning, May 8, 2024, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Senate of Cambodia, received Mr. Khalid Ali Abdullah Abel, Ambassador of Qatar to Cambodia for a courtesy call and discussion.
The courtesy call and discussion was held at the Senate.
