In 2021, a German warship crossed the South China Sea for the first time in nearly 20 years to join a group of Western nations in expanding their military presence in the region. China is rapidly expanding its sphere of influence.
After the reception, Samdech Techo Hun Sen informed the Ambassador that Qatar, which has a large budget, should open its own embassy in Cambodia rather than reside in another country. Samdech Techo also reminded that when Samdech was the Prime Minister, Samdech did not have enough time to receive ambassadors with residences abroad, but for Qatar it was a special case.
Samdech Techo recalled that Cambodia and Qatar began diplomatic relations in 2008 when the Prime Minister of Qatar paid a royal visit to Cambodia.
In response, the Qatari Ambassador greeted and conveyed greetings from the Prime Minister, Minister of Foreign Affairs and President of the Qatari Parliament to Samdech Techo and the people of Cambodia and congratulated him on his new role as President of the Senate. Cambodia.
The Ambassador thanked Samdech Techo and said that it was an honor for him to pay a courtesy call on Samdech today and hope that Qatar will have a residence in Cambodia in the future. Strive to increase diplomatic relations to a higher level, expand relations with Cambodia, especially in the field of food security, because Cambodia is a country that produces food.
Samdech Techo expressed his gratitude to the Prime Minister of Qatar for sending greetings from the Prime Minister, Foreign Minister and Senate, and expressed his condolences over the last World Cup in Qatar, which he wished to attend but failed to attend. Therefore, at this meeting, the Qatari Ambassador took the ball kicked in the World Cup to the prince as a souvenir.
At the same time, Samdech Techo reminded that Qatar should resume Qatar Airline flights after being suspended due to the past Kovid to allow people-to-people contacts as well as bring guests from the Middle East and Europe to Cambodia. Also brings guests from Cambodia and ASEAN to Qatar.
The Ambassador thanked Samdech Techo for explaining in detail the investment climate. The ambassador recalled that the reason he came here was to reap what was in the interests of both countries.
He promised to work hard to recruit investors from Cambodia, as well as bring investors from Cambodia to Qatar to explore the possibility of investment cooperation.
The ambassador said he was also looking at some of the favorable factors that guarantee Qatar's investment in Cambodia. Qatar has the potential to invest in energy, oil and gas, infrastructure, hospital construction, airports and more, and Qatar is reviewing the resumption of Qatar Airline, citing Qatar tourism benefits. Go to different areas.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also asked the Ambassador to send a message of greetings to the King to the Speaker of the National Assembly and the Prime Minister of Qatar and hoped that the relations between the two countries would improve after the presence of the Ambassador. Now.
The ambassador promised to visit Cambodia often. He also expressed his appreciation to Samdech Techo for his clear understanding of the strategy to lead Cambodia from a war-torn country to a country of complete peace and development.
