(Siem Reap): The Siem Reap Provincial Court has decided to detain three more people in connection with the gang-rape of a 15-year-old girl, which has caused a great deal of controversy on social media.
A press release issued by the Siem Reap Provincial Court on May 8 stated that yesterday, the police brought three defendants to appear before a judge in a case of gang rape, after questioning and examining the evidence and In fact, the judge decided to detain the three men and put them in prison.
So far, eight people have been arrested and detained in connection with the rape.
