(Svay Rieng): Mr. Ros Pharith, Deputy Governor of Svay Rieng Province, on the morning of May 7, 2024, opened a training course on "Organizing a forum between the Royal Government and the sub-national administration on decentralization and deconcentration reform to participate. Achieve the vision of Cambodia in 2050.
He said the expected outcome of the forum was that the progress and implementation of decentralization and deconcentration reforms were clearly examined and evaluated, and that challenges related to the reform work were addressed. Define specific measures for each administrative level, both at the national and sub-national levels, and at the level of the Royal Government as a whole.
