NEC revised some content for the 2024 4th Mandate Council Election
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Prach Chan, Chairman of the National Election Committee (NEC), on April 7, 2024, held a meeting to review and decide on the content of educational videos produced for dissemination and Examine some documents related to the Capital Council Election, Provincial Council, Municipal Council, District Council, Khan Council, 4th Mandate 2024.
