First: Agreed on the content of 2 music videos, 2 gestures and 2 animated video spots for the Capital Council, Provincial Council, Municipal Council, District Council, Khan Council, 4th Mandate 2024.
Second: Agree on the content, appeal and instructions for the Capital Council, Provincial Council, Municipal Council, District Council, Khan Council, 4th Mandate 2024, including:
* Campaign-related appeal. * Call for calm on White Day and Election Day. * Guidelines for political party marching.
Third, the NEC decided to validate the official voter list on May 9, 2024 for the Capital Council, Provincial Council, Municipal Council, District Council, Khan Council, 4th mandate 2024.
