Phase 1: The ceasefire lasts for 42 days and Hamas agrees to release 33 Israeli hostages in exchange for the release of Palestinians from Israeli prisons. Israel must withdraw part of its army from Gaza and allow Palestinians to travel freely from south to north of Gaza.
