This morning, Samdech Thipadei Hun Manet officially announced the implementation of "One Nation Standing System"
The "Single National Checkout System" also plays an important role in connecting to the ASEAN Single Checkout System to exchange data on certificates of origin, customs clearance data and other trade documents electronically with other countries. ASEAN members as well.
The implementation of a one-stop-shop system will bring many benefits to both the public and private sectors. For the public sector, the one-stop-shop system plays an important role in facilitating and strengthening cooperation between relevant ministries and institutions to increase the efficiency and effectiveness of trade facilitation. In particular, facilitate the speedy completion of export-import procedures in accordance with the strategy and policy of the Royal Government.
The system will also provide significant benefits to relevant ministries and institutions to obtain accurate and timely information and data for risk assessment analysis and for other needs.
